   "title": "梯度真题",
   "html": "<div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl basic\">基础</span><span class=\"p-tag type\">选择/计算</span><span class=\"p-title\">(101101)₂ → 十六进制</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>分组：10 1101 → 2 D，得 (2D)₁₆ = 45。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">1011 01  -&gt; 分组(补前导0): 0010 1101</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">0010 = 2, 1101 = 13 = D</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">=&gt; (2D)16</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答案 <b>(2D)₁₆</b>。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl mid\">中档</span><span class=\"p-tag type\">选择/计算</span><span class=\"p-title\">(3E8)₁₆ → 十进制</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>3·256 + 14·16 + 8 = 768+224+8 = 1000。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">(3E8)16 = 3*16^2 + 14*16^1 + 8*16^0</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">= 3*256 + 14*16 + 8 = 1000</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答案 <b>1000</b>。记住 (3E8)₁₆ 正好是 1000，常考。</div></div><div class=\"problem\"><div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"lvl hard\">压轴</span><span class=\"p-tag type\">选择/计算</span><span class=\"p-title\">将 0.625 转为二进制（保留）</span></div><div class=\"p-body\"><p>乘 2 取整：0.625×2=1.25→1，0.25×2=0.5→0，0.5×2=1.0→1；顺序得 0.101。</p><div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"lang\">C++</span><button class=\"copy-btn\">复制</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><table class=\"hl\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"ln\">1</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">0.625 * 2 = 1.25 -&gt; 1</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">2</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">0.250 * 2 = 0.50 -&gt; 0</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">3</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">0.500 * 2 = 1.00 -&gt; 1</span></td></tr><tr><td class=\"ln\">4</td><td class=\"code\"><span class=\"cpp-src\">=&gt; 0.101</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"p-analysis\"><span class=\"label\">▍解析：</span>答案 <b>0.101</b>。</div></div>",
   "text": "基础 选择/计算 (101101)₂ → 十六进制 分组：10 1101 → 2 D，得 (2D)₁₆ = 45。 C++ 复制 1 1011 01 -> 分组(补前导0): 0010 1101 2 0010 = 2, 1101 = 13 = D 3 => (2D)16 ▍解析： 答案 (2D)₁₆ 。 中档 选择/计算 (3E8)₁₆ → 十进制 3·256 + 14·16 + 8 = 768+224+8 = 1000。 C++ 复制 1 (3E8)16 = 3*16^2 + 14*16^1 + 8*16^0 2 = 3*256 + 14*16 + 8 = 1000 ▍解析： 答案 1000 。记住 (3E8)₁₆ 正好是 1000，常考。 压轴 选择/计算 将 0.625 转为二进制（保留） 乘 2 取整：0.625×2=1.25→1，0.25×2=0.5→0，0.5×2=1.0→1；顺序得 0.101。 C++ 复制 1 0.625 * 2 = 1.25 -> 1 2 0.250 * 2 = 0.50 -> 0 3 0.500 * 2 = 1.00 -> 1 4 => 0.101"
